OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 50 arrested at Palestine
OL,4,AAction support rally
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 demonstrators have been
OL,7,Farrested outside the Labour Party
OL,8,Fconference in Liverpool during a
OL,9,Fprotest in support of the banned
OL,10,FPalestine Action group, police have
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FMore than 250 protesters sat outside
OL,14,Fthe conference centre earlier, many
OL,15,Fholding home-made banners which read:
OL,16,F"I support Palestine Action".
OL,18,FScores of police officers stood by
OL,19,Fbefore moving in to start making
OL,20,Farrests, warning protesters they were
OL,21,Fillegally holding signs supporting a
OL,22,Fproscribed organisation.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
