OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 50 arrested at Palestine
OL,4,AAction support rally
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter asking them if they were going to
OL,7,Fcontinue to do so, officers led some of
OL,8,Fthe protesters away, telling them they
OL,9,Fhad been arrested under the Terrorism
OL,10,FAct.
